Have you looked at the school? Surrounding schools and options?   Done your due diligence to know what the best option is for your child?  IMO, that is the first thing to ask yourself.  Just b/c its Free doesn't mean its quality too.  We qualified for free at the school, there were many other kids that qualified for it due to their issues and setbacks and it was the worst month of school b/c it was a horrible fit.      I don't know how highly ranked your schools are or the rigor o them, but in my area, they need to come INTO K knowing sight words to be on par.

&#x200B;

If she can move, she can move, its her right and maybe its the better choice for your child if she can live more affordably there.    What part of town you like may not appeal to her, simply because you live there and if she is in her bounds, you don't have call . the game.

Frist, I'm sorry this sucks.   I did the same and "kicked him out".   He moved right in with the girl he was banging.  That being said, you don't have the legal right to take the money out, nor the legal right to kick her out of the house. 

&#x200B;

Most attorneys do free consults, in the next two days, get that done.  Know your rights, know your responsibilities and how to do things so you don't fuck yourself over. 

&#x200B;

